      "gap": "The entry promises the bound also for the strict event A={max_{0<=j<=n} X_j^+ > lambda} (handbook/parts/p15/martingale-maximal-inequalities.tex 80), but the annex gives only 'replace the threshold condition by X_j>lambda; the same proof gives the stated weak bound for its strict event' (handbook/annex/p15/martingale-maximal-inequalities.tex 94-96). Write the strict-event proof: the stopping time T=inf{j: X_j>lambda} wedge n, X_T>lambda on A, X_T=X_n on the complement of A, the subtraction of the equal contributions on A^c from EX_T<=EX_n, and X_n 1_A <= X_n^+. The strict version is used by the proofs of thm:p15-doob-lp-maximal (handbook/annex/p15/martingale-maximal-inequalities.tex 130) and thm:p15-doob-llogl (handbook/annex/p15/martingale-maximal-inequalities.tex 479).",
